Package: xfce4-session
Version: @DEB_XFCE4SESSION_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: System
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libxfce4util7, libxfce4ui-2-0, xfconf, libsm6, libice6
Description: Session manager for the Xfce desktop environment
 xfce4-session starts the Xfce desktop and manages the session lifecycle
 (autostart, logout/restart). On iOS there is no seat/logind, so power actions
 are limited; components may also be launched directly without it.
